NT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">단체</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">시민 등을 대상으로 호국정신을 함양하고 올바른 역사관과 국가관을 정립하기 위한 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2017</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">년 나라사랑정신 함양교육</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">을 실시코자 하오니 붙임 서식을 참고하여<u><strong> </strong></u></span><u><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2017. 9. 22(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></strong></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\"><u><strong>까지 </strong></u>교육을 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">선착순 신청 접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt